- [Twitter-Bootstrap](https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap).

- [pffxg.sh](https://github.com/joesuf4/home/blob/wsl/bin/pffxg.sh).

- Logo-Design von Grafiker (und Allround-Renaissance-Mann) Joel Suraci.

